02:38.660 --> 02:41.140
So now we're going to go and paste our views.

02:41.140 --> 02:43.300
So we have here our three views.

02:43.300 --> 02:46.460
And as usual at the start we're going to describe the purpose of the views.

02:46.460 --> 02:48.540
So we are seeing create gold views.

02:48.540 --> 02:50.940
This script can go and create views for the code layer.

02:50.940 --> 02:54.580
And the code layer represents the final dimension and fact tables.

02:54.580 --> 03:00.020
The star schema which view perform transformations and combination data from the server layer to produce

03:00.020 --> 03:01.300
business ready datasets.

03:01.340 --> 03:04.140
And those views can be used for analytics and reporting.

03:04.140 --> 03:05.180
