03:19.580 --> 03:22.340
in order to validate the dimensions and facts.

03:22.340 --> 03:24.180
So we're going to go to the test over here.

03:24.180 --> 03:25.820
And we're going to go and create a new file.

03:25.820 --> 03:29.300
