03:33.220 --> 03:36.300
So we have the check for the fact the two dimensions.

03:36.340 --> 03:38.780
And as well an explanation about the scripts.

03:38.780 --> 03:42.020
So we are validating the integrity and the accuracy of the gold layer.

03:42.020 --> 03:46.460
And here we are checking the uniqueness of the surrogate keys and whether we are able to connect the

03:46.460 --> 03:47.180
